{"3916360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lightyears of Fervent Warfare", "steam_appid": 3916360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4827710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Lightyears of Fervent Warfare?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Neh empire has the Planets of the Kex star system in its iron grasp. You steal a ship and your perilous journey on the sky road to freedom unfolds! Complete bounties on the way an use the rewards to unlock and upgrade your ship's arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/c621bc74aa8ba4e39472e4782243ffba.poster.avif?t=1781102292\" width=320 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/c621bc74aa8ba4e39472e4782243ffba.webm?t=1781102292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/c621bc74aa8ba4e39472e4782243ffba.mp4?t=1781102292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LoFW's Feature Set</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some features, with more to come (I'm open to suggestions!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable and upgradeable ship tech that packs a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player local co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot! Loot! Loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space shotguns! Remote controlled drones! Homing swarm missiles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grungy player ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is unique!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each explosion is unique!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty missions. Earn to upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a tutorial with friendly alien Wex!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/630c5bc18709fcf1b9a752d13f83d8d6.poster.avif?t=1781102292\" width=320 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/630c5bc18709fcf1b9a752d13f83d8d6.webm?t=1781102292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/630c5bc18709fcf1b9a752d13f83d8d6.mp4?t=1781102292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/95b8ee358ec4b9ccc0776fe46f272a7d.avif?t=1781102292\" width=480 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/42cbf7c64b6aa42d37086bb64b1437d2.avif?t=1781102292\" width=480 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Lightyears of Fervent Warfare?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Neh empire has the Planets of the Kex star system in its iron grasp. You steal a ship and your perilous journey on the sky road to freedom unfolds! Complete bounties on the way an use the rewards to unlock and upgrade your ship's arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><spa